  "title": "Sign Of The Hammer",
  "notes": "Originally released 25th of October 1984 in the UK, by 10 records.\r\n\r\nRecorded at Phase One Studios, Toronto, Canada from November 1983 to Manor Studios, Oxford UK 1984.\r\nIt was announced with [m=552570].\r\n\r\n\"Thor (The Powerhead)\" is about the Norse God Thor.\r\nThe song often brings about the Ragnarök, with \"live to fight on that final day\" stated many times. \r\n\r\nThe following two songs show a turn lyricaly to real facts\r\n\"Guyana (Cult of the Damned)\" is a song about the 1978 mass suicide led by Jim Jones of the Peoples Temple group, at Jonestown, northwestern Guyana.\r\n\"Mountains\" refers to the Vietnam war.\r\n\r\nIn 2005, Sign of the Hammer was ranked number 418 in Rock Hard magazine's book of The 500 Greatest Rock & Metal Albums of All Time.\r\n_______________________________\r\n\r\n1984\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/2487496-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]UK first press with matte-UV details[/url] I [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/3528260-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]repress[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/543463-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]EU Sonopress[/url] I [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/11228013-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]misprint[/url] I [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/5243395-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]repress[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/3879109-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]Greece[/url] I [url=https://www.discogs.com/release/1520348-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]Greece[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/5215681-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]Italy[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/3052003-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]France[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/4327669-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]Canada[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/7647938-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer]Mexico[/url]\r\n[url=https://www.discogs.com/release/2503752-Manowar-Sign-Of-The-Hammer-%E3%82%B5%E3%82%A4%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AA%E3%83%96%E3%82%B6%E3%83%8F%E3%83%B3%E3%83%9E%